## Versions

The package version is `0.1.0` in both `CMakeLists.txt` and `app/juizapp.yaml`. When you release a new version, change both.

## Plugins for several OSes in one package

Run `scripts/dev.sh --release` on each OS, collect the `app/plugins/<target>/` directories in one `app/plugins/`, and run `scripts/pack.sh --no-build`.
Each `app/plugins/<target>/` holds the plugin and libjuiz_sdk of that OS.
